# serial_three_clients -- the ordinary shape that has room for three at once.
#
# `serial_cycle_wide.bron` was the first document with any room in it: a ring
# of four, two non-adjacent pairs, both spent in one lap. A ring cannot give
# more than a pair here, and the arithmetic says why. Every domain in a ring
# is adjacent to two others, so a ring of n admits n * (n - 3) / 2 pairs and
# its widest set of mutually-isolated domains is floor(n / 2) -- one at
# three, two at four. A non-adjacent triple wants a ring of six, past the
# four dependents one supervisor holds.
#
# So the shape with room for three is not a ring at all. It is the most
# ordinary shape in this tree: one server and its clients. `serve.rye` gave
# two clients the duplex shape and proved neither hears the other's bell.
# This declaration adds the third, and the isolation `serve.rye` proved by
# refusal becomes room a supervisor can spend.
#
# Each client owns `ask_x`, which it writes and the virtualiser reads; the
# virtualiser owns `back_x`, which it writes and the client reads; and each
# client owns `taken_x` alone, the tail of its own arc, held by no one else.
# No region and no channel joins any client to any other client, so all
# three may hold the machine at the same moment. The virtualiser touches
# every one of them, so it may run beside none.
#
# That last line is the whole finding. A supervisor picking the first domain
# that fits, in the order the document declares them, takes the virtualiser
# and runs one dependent. The widest set here is three, and the two answers
# differ by the shape rather than by the search.
#
# The private tail costs this document a shape verdict, and the cost is
# stated rather than hidden. `taken_x` is held by its client alone, so it
# carries no direction at all -- one writer and no reader -- and a reading
# that derives flow from the grants answers `no directed flow to derive`
# rather than naming a ring. That is honest: a region only one domain can
# reach is memory rather than a wire, and the room this shape has comes from
# exactly that privacy.
#
# Read whole by `caravan/read.rye`; exercised by `caravan/cohort.rye`.

system serial_three_clients

domain serial_virt
domain client_a
domain client_b
domain client_c

channel serial_virt client_a
channel serial_virt client_b
channel serial_virt client_c

region ask_a 4096
region back_a 4096
region taken_a 64
region ask_b 4096
region back_b 4096
region taken_b 64
region ask_c 4096
region back_c 4096
region taken_c 64

grant ask_a client_a rw
grant ask_a serial_virt r
grant back_a serial_virt rw
grant back_a client_a r
grant taken_a client_a rw
grant ask_b client_b rw
grant ask_b serial_virt r
grant back_b serial_virt rw
grant back_b client_b r
grant taken_b client_b rw
grant ask_c client_c rw
grant ask_c serial_virt r
grant back_c serial_virt rw
grant back_c client_c r
grant taken_c client_c rw
